HST Office: saving an unchanged VBA project gives the same module bytes.

Each save added a blank line to every module, because the import turned the final line ending into
one more line, and a form's VB_Base GUIDs were new on every save. The import now stops at the end of
the last line, and the GUIDs are derived from the form name.

